# Live libFuzzer corpus: grown locally, never committed. Read-only seeds live
# in `seeds/`.
/corpus

# The Cargo.lock IS committed: it pins this fuzz crate's crates.io graph, and
# scripts/check-fuzz-lock.sh (run by fuzz.yaml) fails if re-resolving changes
# it. The repo-root .gitignore ignores every Cargo.lock, so re-include it.
!Cargo.lock
